			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 413111101,
					"content": "你們回來了，怎麼樣，宜年做的菜味道還不錯吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "望雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 413111102,
					"content": "很好吃！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 413111103,
					"content": "他說不會參考那份文件…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413111104,
					"content": "是嗎？他去年也是這麼說的…要是他願意根據我們的建議打廣告的話，營收應該會更多才對。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "望雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 413111105,
					"content": "算了，不用在意這些。來，之前說好的禮物，這個「霄燈」給你們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "望雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 413111106,
					"content": "哇，好漂亮的燈，這是怎麼做的呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 413111107,
					"content": "唔…編製的方法我一時半刻也講不清楚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "望雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 413111108,
					"content": "如果你們對「霄燈」感興趣的話，可以去旁邊問問<color=#00E1FFFF>景明</color>，他是負責「霄燈」和「明霄燈」的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "望雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 413111109,
					"content": "那個好大好大的燈，也是他在負責嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 413111110,
					"content": "對，他應該就在旁邊不遠，應該很容易就能找到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "望雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 413111111,
					"content": "要是能親手編個「霄燈」帶給魈的話，他也許會變得開心一點…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413111112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 413111112,
					"content": "我們快去找那位<color=#00E1FFFF>景明</color>問問看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4131112,
